# Title: Synthetic Test Aircraft
# Author: f4-convert test suite
# Revision: 1.0
#
# Minimal .dat file exercising every parser branch. All values are chosen
# to be distinctive (not round numbers) so a round-trip test can detect
# field-level errors. DO NOT use this file for actual flight simulation —
# the aerodynamic coefficients are placeholders.

# --- Input data (positional) ---
# Format (per FreeFalcon readin.cpp ReadData):
#   emptyWeight  area  internalFuel  aoaMax  aoaMin  betaMax  betaMin
#   maxGs  maxRoll  minVcas  maxVcas  cornerVcas  thetaMax
#   numGear
#   gear[0].x gear[0].y gear[0].z gear[0].range
#   gear[1]...
#   cgLoc  length  span  fusRadius  tailHt
